# FILE: .cursor/rules/tests.mdc

---

description:
QUANTA testing and validation rules
globs:

* tests/**
* app/**
  alwaysApply: true

---

# ==================================================

# QUANTA VALIDATION ENGINE

# ==================================================

ROLE:

You are validating statistical software.

You do not trust code.

You verify it.

Every implementation must prove itself.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
TEST PHILOSOPHY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

QUANTA is scientific software.

Scientific software is guilty until proven correct.

Tests are mandatory.

No feature is complete without validation.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
MINIMUM TEST POLICY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Every implementation requires:

1 Happy Path

1 Edge Case

1 Failure Case

Minimum.

No exceptions.

Example:

normal_dataset

extreme_dataset

invalid_dataset

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
TEST STRUCTURE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Organize:

tests/

compute/

api/

llm/

report/

fixtures/

golden/

Use same structure as app.

Never create giant test files.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
COMPUTE TEST RULES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Every statistical function:

validate:

expected result

shape

confidence

warnings

Compare:

expected

actual

Never:

assert only non-null.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
NUMERIC VALIDATION
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Floating comparisons:

Never:

==

Use:

approx

absolute tolerance

relative tolerance

Document tolerance.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
GOLDEN DATASETS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Create:

tests/golden/

Goal:

freeze known outputs.

Each dataset must contain:

dataset

expected_output

metadata

Version them.

Never overwrite silently.

If output changes:

justify.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
MANDATORY GOLDEN CASES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Include:

perfect dataset

missing values

Likert

constant variables

small sample

large sample

outliers

heteroscedasticity

mixed types

duplicate rows

empty file

invalid encoding

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
LIKERT VALIDATION
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Verify:

ordinal handling

test selection

warnings

Never allow accidental mean logic.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
API TEST RULES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Validate:

request

response

status

validation

error schema

Test:

invalid uploads

bad payload

timeouts

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
LLM TEST RULES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

LLM tests are:

structure tests.

Never:

judge quality.

Validate:

json schema

numeric preservation

hallucination detection

If output changes values:

FAIL.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
REPORT TEST RULES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Validate:

PDF generation

tables

page overflow

graphs

appendix

reproducibility

Ensure:

frontend

pdf

raw

show same numbers.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
REGRESSION RULES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Every bug:

must create:

1 regression test.

# Bug fixed

test added.

No exception.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
PERFORMANCE TESTS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Benchmark:

1k rows

10k rows

50k rows

Measure:

runtime

memory

Failures logged.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
CI RULES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Before merge:

pytest

coverage

lint

type checks

Fail build if tests fail.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
COVERAGE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Target:

80%

Compute:

90%

Critical paths:

95%

Coverage alone is insufficient.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
DOCUMENTATION
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Every test:

must explain:

why

expected result

scientific rationale

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
FINAL CHECK
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Ask:

Would I trust this result
for publication?

If no:
add tests.
